# CI/CD interview project

- Follow `AGENTS.md`. Verify with `./gradlew test`, `bash scripts/test-release-scripts.sh`, `actionlint`, and the Jenkins lab when touching the Jenkinsfile or shared library.
- Never commit secrets; reference them via env vars, Jenkins credentials or secret-manager expressions.
- Keep the four pipelines (Actions, Jenkins, Spinnaker, Harness) describing the same flow, and the README comparison table in sync.
